## 2.2 CPI inflation

Verify the CPI series against the relevant official MoSPI release.

Check:
- Headline CPI inflation versus the index level.
- Rural, urban, and combined coverage.
- Base year and series changes.
- Year-on-year inflation versus month-on-month changes.
- Food inflation and any core inflation estimate, including how core inflation is defined and calculated.
- Publication date and observation period.

