## 2.3 RBI monetary policy

Verify the repo rate and related corridor rates against official Reserve Bank of India Monetary Policy Committee resolutions.

Check:
- Repo rate.
- Standing Deposit Facility rate.
- Marginal Standing Facility rate.
- Bank Rate.
- Effective date.
- Basis-point change from the preceding policy rate.
